      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "local_ref": "e6",
      "text": "摘要指出：“The ring is often described as ‘Pseudo-Minoan’ because
its iconographic and stylistic features do not fully accord with standard Minoan
signet rings and show borrowings from Egyptian iconography, arguments used by 
some scholars to suggest a modern forgery.”",
      "document_ref": "d3",
      "source_ref": "s3",
      "evidence_type": "quote",
      "locator": null,
      "qualifiers": [],
      "limitations": [
