    {
      "local_ref": "e7",
      "text": "摘要描述：“The composition of the boat, deity, altars, trees and 
other elements on the ring is almost collage-like and unparalleled in the 
archaeological record, which has been taken as supporting evidence by those 
arguing for a modern pastiche.”",
      "documentRef": "d3",
      "source_ref": "s3",
      "evidence_type": "quote",
      "locator": null,
      "qualifiers": [],
      "limitations": [
