period and treat it as a Minoan artifact, whereas the Academia.edu paper reports
that the ring has been discussed in the context of Aegean forgeries and 
authenticity debates, with some scholars questioning whether it is a genuine 
Bronze Age object.", "conflict_type": "factual", "source_ids": 
["20260628180638176961_15c55d96", "20260628180627919021_b2e5c47b", 
"20260628180637996478_4ed0ad3f"]}, {"id": "20260628180642351116_59a22dff", 
"description": "Boardman and Nature link the Ring of Nestor to a sepulchral 
treasure from Thisbe in Boeotia and to the Treasure of Thisbe donated by Evans, 
while The Past article associates the ring with the Pylos area by stating that 
it was previously the only gold signet ring known from that area, creating 
tension between a Boeotian findspot and a Pylian regional association in popular
discourse.", "conflict_type": "factual", "source_ids": 
["20260628180638137344_cb886f06", "20260628180638068229_6ba8230a", 
"20260628180637996478_4ed0ad3f"]}, {"id": "20260628181151647965_bfc0aae0", 
"description": "Evans 将“Ring of Nestor”视为晚期迈锡尼 / 晚期米诺斯 III 
期墓葬中的青铜时代金制印章戒指，并据其图像讨论米诺斯来世观；而晚近学者（Academia
.edu 论文）则认为该戒指的图像可能反映 1920 
年代文化实践，暗示其真实性或原始背景存在疑问。", "conflict_type": "factual", 
"source_ids": ["20260628180627919021_b2e5c47b", 
"20260628181146937810_ba17641f"]}, {"id": "20260628181717331010_ddc6e1c6", 
"description": "剑桥丛书章节在整体上将“Ring of Nestor”视为真实的古代文物，而 
Hudler 
引述的同时代学者则明确将其斥为现代伪作，体现对戒指真伪判断上的学术分歧。", 
"conflict_type": "factual", "source_ids": ["20260628180627952652_31025e3c", 
"20260628180725546200_0e5b5e1a"]}, {"id": "20260628181854054872_f4cff2ee", 
"description": "Evans presents the Ring of Nestor as an authentic Late Bronze 
Age Mycenaean-period artifact with Minoan-related afterlife imagery and secure 
funerary provenance from Thisbê, whereas later scholars such as Vlachopoulos and
Eliopoulos classify it as a 'gemma dubitanda' or pseudo-Minoan object with 
problematic provenance and anomalous iconography, and the Journal of Ancient 
Egyptian Interconnections article explicitly treats it as pseudo-Minoan and 
likely modern or hybrid, while Pini’s technical study argues that manufacturing 
features support its authenticity as a Bronze Age object despite the 
questionable context.", "conflict_type": "factual", "source_ids": 
["20260628181849788871_b2f4c6ca", "20260628180627919021_b2e5c47b", 
"20260628181849748548_38fcfd49", "20260628181849708644_ed58ecf6", 
"20260628180725501253_8fd75c2b"]}, {"id": "20260628181924857955_46d857ff", 
"description": "关于 Nestor 戒指真实性的冲突：部分来源（如 2011 年《The 
Pseudo-Minoan Nestor Ring and Its Egyptian 
Iconography》及被引用的学者）倾向于将其视为伪作或至少高度可疑，而其他来源（例如 
Cambridge 的“Fakes and Dubitanda”章节和 Vlachopoulos 
2020）则在承认争议的前提下认为它是真实的爱琴青铜时代器物。", "conflict_type": 
"factual", "source_ids": ["20260628181849708644_ed58ecf6", 
"20260628180725546200_0e5b5e1a", "20260628181920503854_0138e9ae"]}, {"id": 
"20260628181925170874_dfdf56ce", "description": "关于 Nestor 
戒指出土地与背景的叙述存在差异：Evans 及其后 Ashmolean 
出版物将其描述为来自玻奥提亚 Thisbe 一处墓葬“sepulchral 
treasure”的一部分，而后期学者（如 Vlachopoulos 以及 2011 
年文章）强调该戒指实际上是通过艺术市场获得、缺乏经考古发掘验证的墓葬背景。", 
"conflict_type": "factual", "source_ids": ["20260628181849708644_ed58ecf6", 
"20260628181920503854_0138e9ae", "20260628181920468761_7f15b063", 
"20260628180725501253_8fd75c2b"]}, {"id": "20260628181925383224_6b6939e8", 
"description": "关于如何解读戒指图像学异常的冲突：2011 
